%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: MiriamFullMutantDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Something drips from her chin onto the counter. She does not acknowledge
      it.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Her head is at the wrong angle. It has been since she arrived. She has
      not corrected it.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: The cervical vertebrae. The atlas. The axis. She mouths the names slowly,
      like a recitation. Old habit.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: She spreads one hand flat across the glass. The swellings at her knuckles
      press white against it.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: She is watching your throat. Specifically, the part just below the jaw.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Miriam. Look at me.
      npcResponse: The scream arrives before she opens her mouth. Every pane in the
        booth rings. Then silence. Then just the dripping again.
      animationTrigger: 
    - playerChoiceText: What do you want?
      npcResponse: She mouths it very slowly. O-p-e-n. Her fingers spread flat against
        the glass. The latch on your side clicks.
      animationTrigger: 
  - type: 0
    npcLine: She tilts her head the other way. The sound it makes is wet and very
      slow.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: She studied very hard. She remembers all of it. She wants you to know
      that.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
